  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Salmon",
  "description": "These broiled salmon fillets are coated with a herb mayonnaise flavored with garlic, lemon, and Dijon mustard to make an easy, elegant fish dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
